{"content":[{"id":"3116ffa4","settings":{"flex_direction":"row","flex_gap":{"unit":"vw","size":"","column":"","row":"","isLinked":true},"boxed_width":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"background_background":"classic","background_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":"","alt":"Historique","source":"library"},"tp_display_rules":[{"_id":"8bdf6a5"}],"as_bs_lists":[],"as_bs_lists_h":[],"as_ts_lists":[],"as_ts_lists_h":[],"as_ds_lists":[],"as_ds_lists_h":[],"boxed_width_tablet":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"boxed_width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"min_height":{"unit":"px","size":0,"sizes":[]},"flex_justify_content":"space-around","flex_align_items":"flex-start","flex_gap_tablet":{"unit":"vw","size":"","sizes":[],"column":"","row":"","isLinked":true},"flex_gap_mobile":{"unit":"vw","size":"","sizes":[],"column":"","row":"","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"b458f7e","settings":{"editor":"<p class=\"p1\">Le Village se situe dans la Commune d\u2019Haapiti au sud-ouest de l\u2019\u00eele, r\u00e9gion peu habit\u00e9e de l\u2019\u00eele et encore tr\u00e8s pr\u00e9serv\u00e9e des habitations et complexes h\u00f4teliers.<\/p><p class=\"p1\">La visite du village s\u2019effectue par la r\u00e9ception ou vous trouverez des produits artisanaux, par\u00e9os et autres souvenirs, vous y serez accueillis par Valentine et Nelly avec le l\u00e9gendaire sourire polyn\u00e9sien.<\/p><p class=\"p1\">Le Village est ensuite constitu\u00e9 d\u2019une vingtaine de Fare (habitation traditionnelle), o\u00f9 le rez-de-jardin est destin\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019exposition. L\u2019\u00e9tage est occup\u00e9 par les familles habitants le village.<\/p>","tp_display_rules":[{"_id":"d39ed8f"}],"as_bs_lists":[],"as_bs_lists_h":[],"as_ts_lists":[],"as_ts_lists_h":[],"as_ds_lists":[],"as_ds_lists_h":[],"__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals\/typography?id=text","text_color":"globals\/colors?id=primary"},"drop_cap":"yes"},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"